category: Libs
requires: cygwin libcjson1 libcurl4 libgcc1 liblz4_1 libsasl2_3 libssl3 libzstd1 zlib0
sdesc: "Apache Kafka C/C++ library (runtime)"
ldesc: "librdkafka is a C library implementation of the Apache Kafka protocol,
providing Producer, Consumer and Admin clients. It was designed with message
delivery reliability and high performance in mind, current figures exceed 1
million msgs/second for the producer and 3 million msgs/second for the
consumer."
external-source: librdkafka

